        "Current indexed authorities and eight merged prerequisite result/review/integration records plus M2 were independently re-audited on the normally merged HG037 base before this revision first reset; docs/exec-plans/evidence/KL-019/entry-audit-base-62e75ba.json records that audit. Entry audit verified indexed authorities, merged prerequisite PASS results/integrations and specialist reviews, M2 closure and actual KL025 API/fixture bytes before the first real local reset. Latest protected master including the unrelated KL047 and HG037 merges was incorporated before final testing; the complete twenty-check suite was rerun after rebase.",
        "Keep publication as separate typed request without authorization_scope; preserve all frozen strict wire/role/subject-scope/migration/owner-matrix bytes. Authenticated identity is supplied separately and exact TEST subject/policy/environment/principal bindings are reread under S51/S01.",
        "Reuse existing T3/T6/T7 transaction owners, SafetyRegistry coordination and certificate/current-eligibility evaluators. Add only exact first-use S38/S44 and immutable prepared/current-basis accessors/checks to transactions.py; no generic insert grants or caller-writable timestamps.",
        "First head calendar derives from immutable policy timezone and trusted database time, exact real intent day, null parent/revision zero then guarded revision one; S01 serializes missing natural keys. First session is APP_STARTED and exact immutable START binding, server accepted_at and revision one complete atomically.",
        "Bootstrap only registered upstream TEST S01/policy/program/artifacts/SEALED factset/projections/READY candidate. Actual service T3 creates Manifest/projection bindings. Actual KL024 admission/acquire creates intent/request/attempt/root budgets/fence/lease. Missing upstream owners require explicitly synthetic S26/current COMMIT_READY plus S34-S37 certificate input setup outside target transactions.",
        "Finite issuance certificate is server-computed with every exact persisted dependency identity/bound, complete transitive artifact/TIMELESS approval and minimum verified independently. Caller may only shorten. Every historical publish/commit/START replay returns original IDs and executable=false, including authority loss/expiry/revocation.",
        "Preserve transaction fixture complete bytes and mechanically exact planning/ledger namespace transformations. Namespace proof runs before real lifecycle; four distinct lowercase tested-SHA/resolved-worktree-derived namespaces are inventoried and cleanup uses selected targets only. Broader tests/db runs only unchanged hosted ubuntu-latest CI.",
        "Preserve c739273 ACK-loss setup and 7cdee15 oracle-query failure logs as historical evidence. The superseded bf00942 candidate passed all twenty checks; final TEST_ONLY policy scope and exact first-use day/session defenses were added before the final full run."
      ],
