      "decisions": [
        "Reuse the merged CommitBundle/Reauthorize and StartSession/ResumeSession/ContinueSession owners and their command-specific registry routines; add no second owner, registry gate, authorization store or migration.",
        "Compute certificate material only from authoritative database reads made while the existing S51-to-S01 transaction guard is held; caller-requested expiry can only shorten the finite result.",
        "Preserve each dependency's authoritative persisted validity start in the certificate and deny future-effective manifest, resolution, validation, or projection rows.",
        "Canonicalize every certificate and artifact-closure instant to UTC RFC3339 Z before JSON hashing so connection TimeZone cannot change an immutable digest.",
        "Model TIMELESS as a revocable exact artifact with a nonempty reason and an explicit POLICY or POLICY_BUNDLE dependency in the same transitive certificate closure; never synthesize an infinite S42 end.",
        "Interpret the existing synchronous S18 projection narrowly and fail closed for an unknown, cross-wired or noncanonical S18/S17 state.",
        "Return current T7 eligibility as an immutable non-bearer observation; command mutation still re-evaluates through the owner and cannot consume a cached query result as authority.",
        "Use isolated Compose/database namespaces and PostgreSQL pg_blocking_pids with bounded joins for the concurrency oracle; use no sleep as a correctness oracle.",
        "Preserve product requirement status separately; KL-022 claims no product requirement PASS."
      ],
      "known_limitations": [
        "The public eligibility E2E uses a canonically registered isolated TEST subject and intentionally stops before S45 or any execution mutation; KL-019 and KL-027 retain ownership of their broader trajectories.",
        "Current controls are derived from the existing S18/S17 projection and policy-derived exact execution scope; this task adds no new control taxonomy or service.",
        "Task PASS does not imply product requirement PASS, independent review PASS, CI PASS or MERGED state."
      ],
      "follow_up_tasks": [
        "Obtain fresh SHA-bound GENERAL, PROTOCOL and DB_CONCURRENCY independent reviews on the immutable result head."
      ],
