      "decisions": [
        "Reuse the single KL-015 owner and existing S15/S16 storage; add no migration, owner, or frozen-baseline change.",
        "Bind ingress-authenticated RoleIdentity and subject to the registered namespace and freeze the unique builder at BeginBuild.",
        "Keep S01 snapshot capture in a separate short read transaction; serialize missing BeginBuild identity with S15-local advisory locking and persist exact command hashes/outcomes in immutable build content.",
        "Reconstruct one repeatable-read candidate snapshot and validate all typed references before acquiring S15; Complete rejects any changed member revision.",
        "At policy factset_max_delta_depth, capture a complete FULL checkpoint in existing S15 typed content, drop parent dependency, and overlay subsequent S16 SET/REMOVE operations.",
        "Seal reads only fixed scalar certificate fields and stored basis digest, validates current frontier/epoch/program/policy, and commits S15/S01/S02/S03/S04 through the existing T2-SEAL owner.",
        "Keep the initial d611ac8 raw evidence, including the regression failure that led to restoring separate snapshot capture; final PASS evidence is bound exclusively to tested_commit.",
        "Bind Complete natural replay to the immutable closed completion and Seal natural replay to the original successful subject/build/builder completion through bounded S03/S02 lookup; do not create alias receipts or repoint later heads.",
        "Defer stale Begin snapshot rejection until after the advisory-locked durable replay recheck so an ACK-loss duplicate survives concurrent frontier advancement.",
        "Allow SUBJECT/TEST builders only; evaluation evidence cannot enter the live canonical build/seal path.",
        "Integrate the latest merged KL-050 master without conflict and rerun every exact packet check on the final implementation revision. Preserve earlier review findings as historical evidence; require fresh reviews of this corrected implementation/result.",
        "Reconstruct historical sealed parents under their own immutable bound, then apply the selected policy bound to the new storage plan; verify depth-1 to depth-0 policy decrease through owner-driven active-policy change, completion and seal."
      ],
      "known_limitations": [
        "B01-B03/I08, product/release acceptance and production activation remain unchanged; this task promotes no product requirement or release gate to PASS.",
        "Trusted ingress must authenticate and bind BuilderIdentity; the Python value object is not an authentication token.",
        "Policy bundles must explicitly supply factset_max_delta_depth for this service; unsupported/missing configuration fails closed.",
        "Association/admission/mapping selection and downstream qualification belong to their command owners/resolver; this service retains and validates the complete explicitly selected basis."
      ],
      "follow_up_tasks": [
        "KL-024 must start from merged KL-023 after parent integration/sync; shared transaction_interfaces/user_coordination remain serialized.",
        "KL-032 owns downstream product acceptance B01-B03/I08; no downstream task was launched."
      ],
